flowchart TB
  a["<b>1 · notice</b><br/>a card fires or a row<br/>jumps the leaderboard"]:::c_intel
  b["<b>2 · confirm</b><br/>open the drill-down:<br/>is the flow real or one print?"]:::c_intel
  c["<b>3 · look</b><br/>the ATLAS chart:<br/>where is it in the range?"]:::c_model
  d["<b>4 · forecast</b><br/>pick the frame and<br/>train + forecast"]:::c_model
  e["<b>5 · judge</b><br/>MAPE, coverage, and<br/>does the cone contain it?"]:::c_model
  f["<b>6 · grade</b><br/>backtest the frame:<br/>would this have worked?"]:::c_store
  g["<b>7 · decide</b><br/>trade it yourself, or<br/>write it down and watch"]:::c_neutral
  a --> b --> c --> d --> e --> f --> g
